# config/config.json holds real, machine-specific paths (RawTherapee/ExifTool install
# locations) and previously leaked a real dev machine's Windows username via exiftoolPath -
# local-only from V8 Phase 4 on. config/config.example.json (tracked) is the generic template;
# setup.ps1 copies it to config.json on first run and auto-discovers real local paths.
/config/config.json
